{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18416","headline":"喜雪上窦相公 · 陈羽","name":"喜雪上窦相公","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"千门万户雪花浮，点点无声落瓦沟。\n全似玉尘销更积，半成冰水结还流。\n光添曙色连天远，平地已沾盈尺润，年丰须荷富人侯。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈羽","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18416.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18416","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}